  "title": "Kanoni et al. supplemental visualizations",
  "bodyHtml": "<p>These links lead to supplemental visualizations that accompany the publication:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Implicating genes, pleiotropy, and sexual dimorphism at blood lipid loci through multi-ancestry meta-analysis.<br />\r\nKanoni S, Graham SE, Wang Y, Surakka I, Ramdas S, Zhu X, <i>et al.</i><br />\r\nGenome Biol. 2022 Dec 27;23(1):268. doi: 10.1186/s13059-022-02837-1.<br />\r\nPMID: <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/36575460\" target=\"_blank\"> 36575460 </a></p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Effector gene predictions:</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"/research.html?pageid=GLGC_HDL_137\" target=\"_blank\">HDL cholesterol</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"/research.html?pageid=GLGC_LDL_150\" target=\"_blank\">LDL cholesterol</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"/research.html?pageid=GLGC_nonHDL_151\" target=\"_blank\">non-HDL cholesterol</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"/research.html?pageid=GLGC_TC_153\" target=\"_blank\">Total cholesterol</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"/research.html?pageid=GLGC_logTG_152\" target=\"_blank\">Log-Triglycerides</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"/research.html?pageid=mouse_pheno_154\" target=\"_blank\">\"Silver set\" mouse knockouts with lipid-related phenotypes</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Polygenic score PheWAS:</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"/research.html?pageid=GLGC_HDL_PheWAS_141\" target=\"_blank\">HDL cholesterol</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"/research.html?pageid=GLGC_LDL_PheWAS_143\" target=\"_blank\">LDL cholesterol</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"/research.html?pageid=GLGC_nonHDL_PheWAS_144\" target=\"_blank\">non-HDL cholesterol</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"/research.html?pageid=GLGC_TC_PheWAS_146\" target=\"_blank\">Total cholesterol</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"/research.html?pageid=GLGC_TG_PheWAS_147\" target=\"_blank\">Triglycerides</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
